# L §5.2 example sources, copied whole.  "a source that no version cites gets WARN-UNREAD" (L §8.5 message
# "<source ...> is read by nothing").  rm1238 is cited, modeller is not.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2016-03-01
  start 2015-11-01
  end 2016-10-31

source rm1238 "Rozporządzenie Rady Ministrów, Dz.U. 2015 poz. 1238" at "https://isap.sejm.gov.pl/..."
source modeller "The model's own assumptions, each stated with its reason"

input n: int

version v
  cite rm1238
  governs always
  known 2015-09-07
  n = 1

ask q1: n
=== expect
q1: 1
  cut 2016-03-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD source modeller is read by nothing
